# Grid Table Portal Code Riview

## Review Focus
- Demo correctness vs library behavior.
- Accessibility and keyboard parity in examples.
- Alias import consistency and constants hygiene.
- No inline magic values where shared constants are appropriate.
- Applies to all Grid Table workspaces: library + portal.
- Prefer `Name.types.ts` and `Name.const.ts`; reject stale `types.ts`/`constants.ts`.
- Require single `props` argument for TSX components.
- Require helper/object argument when function signature exceeds 3 params.
- Require `clsx` for conditional classes.
- Push complex JSX conditionals into helper functions/components.
- Avoid inline styles where classes/utilities can represent the same output.
- Flag unused params/local vars immediately.

## Build Gates
- Portal build must pass locally.
- Integration with local grid-table build must be validated before merge.
